      "document_id": "runbook-payment-db-pool-v3",
      "title": "Payment API 数据库连接池耗尽处置手册",
      "text": "Payment API 出现 DB_POOL_TIMEOUT、HTTP 503、连接池利用率持续高于 95% 时，先检查慢查询、连接泄漏和最近发布，暂停非必要批处理。任何扩容或回滚都需要值班负责人审批并绑定 action_id，处置后持续观察错误率和 P95 延迟至少 15 分钟。",
      "source_uri": "repo://corpora/incident-runbooks-v1#payment-db-pool",
      "source_type": "runbook",
      "tenant_id": "demo",
      "document_version": "3",
      "effective_at": "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z",
      "license": "project-synthetic",
      "provenance": "project-authored deterministic fixture",
      "metadata": {"service": "payment-api", "symptom": "database_pool_exhaustion", "review_status": "verified"}
    },
    {
      "document_id": "runbook-checkout-db-pool-v1",
      "title": "Checkout API 数据库连接池处置手册",
      "text": "Checkout API 连接获取超时并伴随 DB_POOL_TIMEOUT 时，核对连接池饱和度，检查慢查询、未释放连接和近期配置变更。扩容连接池或回滚配置前必须审批，完成后验证 HTTP 503 与延迟恢复。",
